    'excerpt' => 'This has not been officially rolled out by YouTube yet. But the story, originally published on social media today “ YouTube is beta testing a new \'comment threading\' feature with...',
    'body' => '<p>This has not been officially rolled out by YouTube yet. But the story, originally published on social media today </p><p>“ YouTube is beta testing a new \'comment threading\' feature with premium subscribers, and also adding some additional features to its AI-powered ‘ Dream track’ music options.</p>		
			<h2>Threaded Comments Come to YouTube</h2>		
		<p><a href="https://www.socialmediatoday.com/news/youtube-tests-comment-threading-updates-to-dream-track-ai-music/753768/#:~:text=YouTube%20Tests%20Threaded%20Comments%2C%20Additional%20AI%20Music%20Options,-Published%20July%2022&amp;text=YouTube%20is%20testing%20out%20a,%E2%80%9CDream%20Track%E2%80%9D%20music%20option.">As an initial step on 22/July/2025, Tuesday, YouTube is actively beta testing the ‘ comment threading’ feature on YouTube Premium subscribers. It\'s a significant improvement from the last one, a more limited test.</a></p>		
													<img width="387" height="219" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/youtubecomment_threading.webp" alt="YouTube" />													
		<p>As YouTube Explained:</p><p><i>“Comment threading provides a more focused reading experience and helps users easily understand conversations. Click on the ‘X replies’ button under a comment and view threaded replies in the ‘Replies’ panel. Only available on iOS and Android.”</i></p><p>The comment threads make it easy to follow the conversation by visually connecting replies within the single comment stream. It is similar to how Reddit’s comment section works. The audience can tap on the “ X “replies button to see the full threaded conversation in a dedicated replies panel. So it’s a simplified discussion tracking display, which could help to spark more specific discussions in the comment panels.</p><p>This testing feature is currently rolling out to a wider user base of premium subscribers on IOS and Android. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/new">This Beta testing is set to stay till 14 August 2025.</a> An earlier draft of YouTube’s comment section redesign that attempted to introduce threading was called out for not fully implementing the feature. The current stage of this seems to be a more complete and visually clear threading system.</p>		
			<h2>Dream Track Enhancements</h2>		
		<p>As the second update, YouTube is also testing new updates to its AI-powered dream track beta. Dream track initially launched in 2023 and expanded to U.S.-based creators in the last October. This will help the user to create short audio clips with the text prompt for shorts</p>https://youtu.be/uQY6Z6O_dZQ?si=rJm3T85GJRgLVHiy<p>And now, it’s looking to enhance your AI-generated music outputs, with additional tools that will enable you to further customize your generated tracks.</p><p><a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/youtuybe-tests-threaded-comments-additional-192018551.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com&amp;guccounter=1&amp;guce_referrer=aHR0cHM6Ly9jaGF0Z3B0LmNvbS8&amp;guce_referrer_sig=AQAAAGdZzNvjlDbrxARXMCMoLVnrwL8UjGPlCQP5Zs5s7UHWAJSG4Ce5yE1wgkdda_C9rNTXhvi6wc02y1NU2nH5X4QZZNf8Y2i0aFKV21fiqdu760Ooo9CKSVDRFUweJZnwHfOF8FiqbEwcByb6UtIXYn4R0W2ULfvWhPPKRpQmo0Dc"><i>If you\'re a creator in the test group, you might notice new choices and quality improvements to the tailor-made soundtracks you can produce on your Shorts. These test features are coming to a small group of creators in the U.S.</i></a></p><p>The latest tests for Dream Track seek to improve AI-generated music outputs through "additional tools and quality enhancements" that will enable further customization of generated tracks. Dream track is limited access. These experimental AI music features are currently rolling out to a select group of creators in the U.S. We may have to wait a little bit for them to roll out in India</p><p>YouTube emphasises that the dream track generated can be downloaded and used in videos without worries of copyright claims, as YouTube is offering a valuable resource for creators.</p>		
			<h2>Outlook for these updates</h2>		
		<p>The ongoing tests of threaded comments and expanded AI music options on <a href="https://techbound.in/social-media-updates-in-last-6-months/">YouTube indicate broader strategic directions for the platform, with significant implications for user engagement, content creation, and the monetization ecosystem.</a></p>		
			<h3>Threaded comments</h3>		
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Full rollout and global presence:						
					</h3>
									<p>
						since this beta test with premium users suggests that YouTube is refining the feature. If it maximizes engagement and creates a more positive discussion environment, then it\'s highly probable that thread comments will be rolled out to all user platforms. This would make them a fundamental part of the YouTube experience.
					</p>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Enhanced SEO and Discovery:						
					</h3>
									<p>
						 More structured and pertinent commentary may be able to yield more valuable data for YouTube algorithms, enabling the platform to show more related content and conversation in search results or recommendations. Some articles even go as far as saying that well-organized comment areas can influence AI summaries, like Google Search does.					</p>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34zm192-34l-136-136c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-22.6 22.6c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l96.4 96.4-96.4 96.4c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 33.9l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l136-136c9.4-9.2 9.4-24.4 0-33.8z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Integration with Other Features:						
					</h3>
									<p>
						YouTube could incorporate threaded comments into other features of the platform. For example, creators could simply highlight or "pin" whole threads of comments, or even integrate them directly into Shorts or community posts and transform discussions into new content.					</p>
			<h3>AI music</h3>		
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M223.7 239l136-136c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L319.9 256l96.4 96.4c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L393.7 409c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-136-136c-9.5-9.4-9.5-24.6-.1-34zm-192 34l136 136c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L127.9 256l96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.7 103c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-136 136c-9.5 9.4-9.5 24.6-.1 34z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Equal access to music creation:						
					</h3>
									<p>
						AI music will continue to low barrier to entry for content creators. That will allow anyone to generate high-quality music for their videos without any worries about extensive music knowledge and copyrights. and also not needed for expensive licenses or access to a professional composer. This will be a game-changer for independent creators and small channels					</p>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M223.7 239l136-136c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L319.9 256l96.4 96.4c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L393.7 409c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-136-136c-9.5-9.4-9.5-24.6-.1-34zm-192 34l136 136c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L127.9 256l96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.7 103c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-136 136c-9.5 9.4-9.5 24.6-.1 34z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Interfacing with editing tools: 						
					</h3>
									<p>
						We can expect effortless integration of AI music generation directly within the YouTube Studios editing suite. This feature, like automatically beat-matching and AI-driven recommendations for background music based on your content.
					</p>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M223.7 239l136-136c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L319.9 256l96.4 96.4c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L393.7 409c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-136-136c-9.5-9.4-9.5-24.6-.1-34zm-192 34l136 136c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L127.9 256l96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.7 103c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-136 136c-9.5 9.4-9.5 24.6-.1 34z"></path></svg>				
									<h3>
							Impact on Human Musicians:						
