												<a tabindex="0">Who is the CEO of Telegram?</a>
					<p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pavel_Durov">Pavel Valeryevich Durov </a>is the CEO of Telegram. He is a russian born French. </p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">Why is telegram CEO in Jail?</a>
					<p>Durov , the CEO of Telegram is accused of complicity and negligence involving Telegram&#8217;s use for crimes such as drug trafficking, child sexual exploitation and fraud.</p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">Does Telegram belong to India?</a>
					<p>Telegram is registered as a company in the British Virgin Islands and as an LLC in Dubai in the United Arab Emirates.</p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">Which countries banned Telegram ?</a>
					<p><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Government_censorship_of_Telegram">Azerbaijan, Bahrain, Belarus, Brazil, China, cuba, Czech Republic, Germany, Hong Kong, Indonesia, Iran, Iraq, Norway, Pakistan, Russia, Spain, and Thailand</a></p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">Is telegram an Indian App?</a>
					<p>No. Telegram is not an Indian App. Telegram Messenger LLP is an independent nonprofit company based in Berlin, Germany.</p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">How to hide phone number in Telegram?</a>
					<p>Go settings, click privacy and security, tap phone number, </p><p>Select &#8216;Nobody&#8217; under &#8216;who can see my phone number.&#8217;</p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">What is the difference between Telegram and WhatsApp?</a>
					<p>WhatsApp has end-to-end encryption and requires a phone number for contacting. Telegram stores everything on their servers, and you can talk to someone just by their username.</p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">Does Telegram show your location?</a>
					<p><a href="https://telegram.org/privacy?setln=nl#:~:text=If%20you%20share%20your%20Live,keep%20these%20optional%20features%20activated.">If you share your live location in any chat or turn on &#8216;Make Myself Visible&#8217; in People Nearby, Telegram will use your data to display your location to those users with whom you are sharing it, even when the app is closed—for as long as you keep these optional features activated.</a></p>
															<svg viewBox="0 0 192 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z"></path></svg>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 320 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z"></path></svg>
												<a tabindex="0">What is not allowed in Telegram?</a>
					<p><a href="https://telegram.org/tos/in#:~:text=By%20signing%20up%20for%20Telegram,Telegram%20channels%2C%20bots%2C%20etc.">By signing up for Telegram, you accept Privacy Policy of telegram and agree not to: Use telegram service  to send spam or scam users.</a> </p><p>Promote violence on publicly viewable Telegram channels, bots, etc, Post illegal pornographic content on publicly viewable Telegram channels, bots, etc are not allowed in Telegram.</p>',
