    'author_designation' => 'Founder & Lead Strategist',
    'excerpt' => 'Over the past years, messaging apps have gradually changed and included numerous features to increase their usefulness. But what exactly sets WhatsApp apart from its competitors?...',
    'body' => 'Over the past years, messaging apps have gradually changed and included numerous features to increase their usefulness. But what exactly sets WhatsApp apart from its competitors? Clearly, it\'s the frequent updates on WhatsApp.

WhatsApp has never failed to surprise its users with its updates. New Whatsapp updates that are rolling out this month- the Like button to react Status, chat theme change, App colour, new sticker features and the latest username or pin instead of phone numbers.&nbsp;

Additionally, WhatsApp is advancing meta-AI technology every day. Are you curious about WhatsApp\'s Meta AI?<a href="https://techbound.in/meta-ai-on-whatsapp-how-to-use-features-privacy/"> Check out this blog</a> for an exciting deep dive into the latest innovations and how they\'re transforming your messaging experience!
<h1>New WhatsApp Updates</h1>
From the data we compiled from various sources, we found four confirmed WhatsApp updates that will make the app simpler and more effective. Let’s find it out.
<h3>“Like” Status update</h3>
On the latest beta version of the whatsapp a new functionality is available Now.

Similar to instagram and facebook Now you can add stories with heart emojis.

So the viewers or ones can react to a message with a single click.&nbsp;

A new heart icon appears in the bottom right corner of the screen, close to the reply bar.

The functionality is likely to be slowly sent out to consumers, as Gadget 360 staff members were unable to test it after installing the most recent beta version.

<img width="300" height="615" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/whatsapp-like-reactions-small.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/whatsapp-like-reactions-small.jpg 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/whatsapp-like-reactions-small-146x300.jpg 146w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px">
<h3>Add Additional Chat themes</h3>
<a href="https://wabetainfo.com/whatsapp-beta-for-ios-24-17-10-71-whats-new/">WhatsApp has just submitted a new update through the TestFlight beta Program, bringing the version up to 24.17.10.71.</a>

Its focusing on personalising users\' chat experience with different themes has a unique colour scheme.&nbsp; Although this feature is still under development, it seems that WhatsApp is now in the process of introducing a feature to set a theme for specific chats, as discovered in the latest WhatsApp beta update from the TestFlight app.

The option will be added to the chat info screen, to change the message and background colour as per individual personal opinion and taste. This means that different themes can be used in each chat. That offers a highly personalised chat experience.&nbsp;

So each conversation can have its own unique look and feel, independent of the general settings applied to the rest of the app.

<img width="835" height="472" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chat-theme.jpg" alt="New whatsapp update-Chat theme" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chat-theme.jpg 835w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chat-theme-300x170.jpg 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chat-theme-768x434.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 835px) 100vw, 835px">
<h3>Express Yourself with More Stickers</h3>
<a href="https://blog.whatsapp.com/express-yourself-with-more-stickers">New whatsapp updates offer more stickers to users.</a>
<h6>New and searchable GIPHY stickers:</h6>
Whatsapp Now collaborated with GIPHY to provide their enormous collection of stickers right to WhatsApp. To find these stickers, hit the sticker icon and search for text or emoji.
<h6>Custom Sticker Maker:</h6>
Custom sticker makers are now available for Android. Transform your images into personalised stickers, or customise existing ones.&nbsp;
<h6>AI Stickers:</h6>
You can use Meta AI for creating more stickers.&nbsp; At this time, AI sticker creation is available on iPhone and Android in the U.S.&nbsp;
<h6>Sticker Organisation:</h6>
To manage your sticker tray, tap and hold a sticker to move it to the top or remove it.
<h3>Replace phone numbers with usernames and PIN</h3>
To enhance users\' privacy, WhatsApp starts to introduce a series of new features.

According to a recent report from <a href="https://wabetainfo.com/">WABetaInfo</a>, a WhatsApp features tracker, one of the key updates will be "Username and PIN."

This new feature means to use a username and pin instead of sharing a phone number.&nbsp; This modification allows users to choose not to share their mobile numbers with everyone.&nbsp;

By selecting the "Username" option, users can keep their phone numbers hidden, displaying only a username to others.

However, it is important to note that existing contacts who already have your phone number will still be able to see it. New contacts, however, will only view your username in the profile section.

By selecting the third option, “ user name with pin” introduces a 4-digit PIN that users can share with the users on WhatsApp. Same as above the existing contacts can see the phone number even if the PIN feature is activated.
<h2>The future</h2>
The New WhatsApp updates on 2024 bring exciting changes that promise to enhance user experience and personalisation.

With these upgrades, WhatsApp is demonstrating its dedication to adapting to its users\' requirements and providing greater flexibility and security than before.

&nbsp;Accept these new functions and see how they can improve your communication! In any case, these new WhatsApp updates will be a bonus in the coming social media competition.

We\'re committed to keeping you updated with the latest WhatsApp developments.

<a href="https://techbound.in/">Techbound Innovations Pvt Ltd</a>&nbsp; has highly skilled&nbsp; experts who excel in analysing and understanding emerging tech trends and seamlessly integrating them into strategic marketing plans.',
    'image' => 'https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/New-whatsapp-updates.webp',
    'published_at' => '2024-08-23 06:41:26',
    'active' => 1,
  ],
  [
    'id' => 49863,
    'slug' => 'the-power-of-persuasion-psychology-in-digital-marketing-how-to-impact-customer-behaviour-online',
    'title' => 'The Power of Persuasion Psychology in Digital Marketing: How to Impact Customer Behaviour Online',
    'category' => 'Digital Marketing',
    'tags' => 'Digital Marketing',
    'author' => 'Kishor',
    'author_designation' => 'Founder & Lead Strategist',
    'excerpt' => 'Capturing the power to influence customer behaviour is critical in the dynamic world of digital marketing. Traditional advertising techniques have long since been obsolete; today,...',
    'body' => '<p>Capturing the power to influence customer behaviour is critical in the dynamic world of digital marketing. </p><p>Traditional advertising techniques have long since been obsolete; today, internet audiences must be captivated and loyalized through the use of persuasion psychology concepts. </p><p>However, in the wide world of the internet, what precisely does it take to leave a mark on clients? </p><p>Let us explore how digital marketing architects influence consumer choices and mould brand impressions.</p>		
			<h3>Concerning the Art of Persuasion</h3>		
		<p>Everyone should know the fundamentals of persuasion psychology before delving into the strategies. Contrary to popular assumption, compulsion or manipulation are not the goals of persuasion. </p><p><a href="https://www.britannica.com/science/persuasion-psychology">Persuasion </a>can be an effective technique for influencing favourable results, bringing about change, and accomplishing objectives when it is applied sensibly and morally. </p><p>Empathy, smart communication, and morally sound persuasion tactics are all necessary for the art of persuasion. </p><h4><strong>We illustrate how persuasion psychology applies to a product sale using a case study:</strong></h4><p>“Don\'t pass this up! Our month-end offer ends this week! Buy 2, get 1 free on your favourite goods. Before they disappear, shop now and get your must-haves!”</p><p> Justification: This web store\'s appealing advertisement generates a sense of urgency and FOMO by leveraging the scarcity principle.</p>		
															<img width="944" height="510" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/create-sense-of-urgency-sales.jpg" alt="Persuasion psychology case study" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/create-sense-of-urgency-sales.jpg 944w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/create-sense-of-urgency-sales-300x162.jpg 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/create-sense-of-urgency-sales-768x415.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 944px) 100vw, 944px" />															
			<h2>3 Keys of Persuasion Psychology</h2>		
		<p>Daniel<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel_Kahneman"><b> Kahneman</b></a><b>, </b>the Princeton University Psychology professor, is well known for his psychology of judgement and decision-making. He is the founder of the field of behavioural economics, and he won the Nobel Prize in 2002 for his contributions in economic science.</p><p>He passed away on 27th March 2024. His research illuminated how cognitive biases and heuristics shape human behaviour and economic decision-making.</p><p>Danniel Kahneman suggests there are two ways in which people make decisions. The primary method is fast, reactive, and based on intuition. The second involves a more calculated, slow, and thorough approach.</p><p>According to him, these are the key principles of persuasion psychology</p><h3><strong>Maximise legibility</strong></h3><p>He said that "The first rule of persuasion is to make it simple for your audience to see and read information." So, foremost, improve legibility." </p><p>Convey the points clearly and concisely. Highlight the most significant points that will capture the audience\'s attention. Font size, contrast between background and text colour, spacing between characters, and accessibility have an influence on<a href="https://www.adobe.com/uk/creativecloud/illustration/discover/typography/legibility.html"> legibility.</a></p><h3><strong>Simplify Language</strong></h3>
The second rule is: "Do not use complex sentence structures." It is not a better form of communication. People are drawn to those who communicate plainly.
<h6>For Example</h6>
<ol>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">Create a Facebook ad with a catchy headline. Add an engaging image. Set your target audience and budget. Let it run. Then check the results and tweak as needed. Campaign optimised!</li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">Design a Facebook ad by crafting an attention-grabbing headline that aligns with your brand’s messaging. Incorporate a visually appealing image to capture interest and ensure that your target audience and budget parameters are precisely set to maximise reach and efficiency. Once the ad is launched, monitor its performance metrics closely, and based on the data collected, make necessary adjustments to optimise its effectiveness and improve engagement. This iterative process will ensure your campaign achieves its desired impact and delivers optimal results.</li>
</ol>
The first one directly and simply communicates the point, most probably the second one not leading to the correct point and there is a chance of  miscommunication.
This means you\'ll have to have less text, it\'s a good thing. It takes too much work to read too much text.<h3><strong>Storytelling and Emotional Appeals </strong></h3>
Example;
<ol>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">I have strong feelings for you. I want to spend my life with you. My friends and family agree that we are a great match. Will you marry me?</li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">When I was a child, I once dreamed of a princess who visited me at my bedside and asked me to hold her hand. As we floated together through the sky, she confided that she wanted to marry me. Although I eventually woke up and missed that enchanting princess, I never forgot that dream. Meeting you, I realised that you are the one who fulfils that magical vision. I love you deeply.</li>
</ol>
