In order to get recognition, marketers must concentrate on producing <a href="https://www.semrush.com/blog/snackable-content/">"snackable"</a> content (<em>short-form, easily digestible, and visually engaging content</em>). This goes specifically for mobile devices and platforms such as Instagram.
<h3>Strategic Social Media Marketing Skills</h3>
