.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=".svg"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width="1024" height="1024" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-1024x1024.jpg" alt="WhatsApp\'s voice chat" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-300x300.jpg 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-150x150.jpg 150w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-768x768.jpg 768w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/4e78ea4d-3169-447a-848f-82062fb93ff3.jpg 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px">

<style>/*! elementor - v3.14.0 - 26-06-2023 */<br />
.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>
<h2>What is WhatsApp\'s Voice Chats:</h2>
Unlike traditional voice calls or voice notes that ring each group member individually, the new voice chat feature takes a discrete approach. <b>Users now receive a silent notification</b>, giving them the freedom to choose when to join the conversation.&nbsp;

This innovation caters to individuals with busy schedules or those who prefer a less intrusive means of communication, fostering a more considerate and user-friendly environment.
<h2>Seamless Multitasking:</h2>
One of the standout features of WhatsApp\'s voice chat is its seamless integration with multitasking. <b>Users can control the call and send text messages simultaneously</b>, enhancing the overall user experience.&nbsp;

The end-to-end encryption ensures the privacy and security of conversations, allowing only the participants to access the content.
<h2>Joining and Leaving at Will:</h2>
In a move reminiscent of popular platforms like Discord, <b>WhatsApp\'s voice chat allows users to join and leave the conversation at their convenience</b>.&nbsp;

The call controls conveniently sit atop the group chat, enabling users to seamlessly transition between voice chats and text messaging.&nbsp;

This flexibility is particularly useful for individuals in meetings or situations where intermittent participation is necessary
<h2>How to Engage in WhatsApp\'s Voice Chats:</h2>
<a href="https://faq.whatsapp.com/868728454494559">Initiating a voice chat on WhatsApp</a> is a straightforward process:
<ol>
 	<li> Open the desired group chat.</li>
 	<li> Tap the phone icon in the top right corner.</li>
 	<li> Select "<b>Start Voice Chat</b>."</li>
</ol>
Group members will receive a push notification, and participants can be tracked through the banner at the bottom of the screen. To exit a voice chat, users simply tap the Red Cross button.
<h2>Key Points to Note:</h2>
- Voice chats support multitasking, allowing users to send messages while engaged in a call.

- The feature is end-to-end encrypted, ensuring the privacy of conversations.

- Voice chats are available for groups with 33 to 128 participants.

- This feature is exclusive to the primary device.

- Group members not in the voice chat can view profiles of those engaged in the conversation.

- Voice chats automatically end when all participants leave or if there\'s no activity for 60 minutes.
<h2>Conclusion:</h2>
<a href="https://techbound.in/whatsapp-channels-how-it-differs-from-telegram-channels/">WhatsApp</a>\'s introduction of seamless voice chats for large groups represents a significant leap in enhancing group communication.

The emphasis on user flexibility, privacy, and multitasking capabilities is set to redefine how users engage within their communities.

As this feature rolls out in the coming weeks, <a href="https://techbound.in/meta-ai-latest-whatsapp-feature-update-in-news/">WhatsApp users</a> can anticipate a more dynamic and convenient group communication experience.',
