    'body' => 'Do you recall the first time you saw a "in a parallel universe" meme on social media? It was hilarious and at the same time frustrating. However, the thing is now a reality with the rising popularity of VR ecosystems.&nbsp;A lot of people&nbsp;<a style="text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0px; background-color: #ffffff;" href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/vr-marketing-examples">believe VR is only for games</a>&nbsp;and requires a large technological investment to enjoy the experience. This is not true. It is a powerful tool to engage with people and create memorable experiences. As marketing is all about creating experiences, VR Marketing has become a matter of interest for digital marketers around the globe.

