    'tags' => 'Web Development',
    'author' => 'TechBound Team',
    'author_designation' => 'Digital Marketing Team',
    'excerpt' => 'There is an old saying that Time and Money does not go hand in hand. But this notion of scarcity is now not applicable to all professions. 21st century is considered as a great...',
    'body' => '<p>There is an old saying that Time and Money does not go hand in hand. But this notion of scarcity is now not applicable to all professions. 21st century is considered as a great year for startups with emergence of unicorn startups across the world. Startups although a risky endeavour will give you abundance of time and money when you have the right team on board. One of them must be an experienced digital marketer having a thorough on the ground experience. In this article, we discuss about various Digital Marketing Tips To Build A Successful Start-Up</p>		
			<h3>Digital Marketing Tips To Build A Successful Start-Up</h3>		
															<img width="768" height="415" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/diagram-768x415.png" alt="Tips To Build A Successful Start-Up" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/diagram-768x415.png 768w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/diagram-300x162.png 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/diagram.png 800w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" />															
			<h3>1. Define your target audience
</h3>		
		<p> understand their demographics, preferences, and needs. It will let  you to tailor your marketing efforts specifically to their interests, increasing the chances of engaging and leading to conversions.</p>		
			<h3>2. Develop a strong online presence
</h3>		
		<p> Develop a user-friendly website that showcases your brand. Optimize it for search engines and ensure it is mobile-responsive. Further, create profiles on social media and consistently share valuable content to build a community around your brand.</p>		
			<h3>3. Leverage content marketing</h3>		
		<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;">Create high-quality content such as blog posts, videos, infographics, and podcasts that provide value to your target audience. Share this content on your website and social media channels to attract and engage potential customers. </p>		
			<h3>4. Utilize social media advertising</h3>		
		<p> Social media platforms offer robust advertising options to reach your target audience effectively. Utilize precise targeting options based on demographics, interests, and behaviors to maximize the impact.</p>		
			<h3>5. Implement email marketing</h3>		
		<p> Nurture your subscribers with personalized and relevant emails that provide value and build trust. Use email marketing tools to automate campaigns, segment your audience, and track performance metrics. </p><p>Consistency, tracking results, and adapting your strategies based on data are key to successful digital marketing for any business.</p>',
    'image' => 'https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/diagram-768x415.png',
    'published_at' => '2023-07-07 05:41:16',
    'active' => 1,
  ],
