</ul>
Regulations -Are they aware of relevant regulations in your industry and region?
<ul>
 	<li>Advertising industry is full of regulations that can be confusing, but there are ways to make sure your advertising is compliant and not breaking any rules. Understanding the ASCI guidelines and the FTC can help you make sure you are in a safe zone.</li>
</ul>
Technological capabilities

Recovery Plan -What is the likelihood of recovering from any failure?
