<h4><b>What is Pay-Per-Click, or PPC? How can the effectiveness of your PPC campaign increase?&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></h4>
Let\'s start by defining pay-per-click (PPC), a type of online advertising where you only charge when a user clicks on your ad on a search engine. Following that, you can list the best PPC usage tactics.
<h4><b>What elements go into calculating the Quality Score?</b></h4>
Your ads, keywords, and landing pages will receive a quality score based on how relevant they are. The final factor affecting your CPC for that Ad will be your quality score. Naturally, higher positions and lower costs associate with good quality.&nbsp; A quality score influences three variables: CTR, landing page experience, and relevance.

