<b>Menu guidelines for google business profile are :</b>
<ul>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">The menu must accurately represent the products and services to customers at the venue.&nbsp; Full menus may include connections to other menu pages and may be meal-specific (for example, breakfast, lunch, or supper). For instance, you might decide to connect to the supper menu for your company, which might also include links to the breakfast and lunch menus.</li>
