 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">Fewer remarks to manage</li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1">simplifying online reviews&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<h3>Spend more time and money on video</h3>
Comparatively speaking, video content is the most engaging. As a result, start making small adjustments to your email, social media, and website marketing strategies.

There is good news for you if you are already short on time and money! No one expects Hollywood-level quality after a year of connecting via low-res video, but making videos has never been simpler.

<img width="768" height="433" src="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-768x433.png" alt="Video marketing for Educational institutions" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-768x433.png 768w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-300x169.png 300w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-1024x577.png 1024w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-1536x865.png 1536w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education-480x270.png 480w, https://techbound.in/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Video-Marketing-for-Education.png 1640w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" title="Video Marketing for Education">

